    "detailed_description": "<i>Are you ready to hop on a journey as a merchant in medieval bohemia? Choose your character and start making some profit! </i><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Buy!</h2></strong><br>Buy low, sell high, trading at its simplest form. 18 different trade goods to choose from.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel!</h2></strong><br>11 unique cities to travel to! Find which one pays the most for your goods.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sell!</h2></strong><br>A good merchant always finds a way to fill their pockets. It's up to you to find the most profitable route.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recruit!</h2></strong><br>Roads aren't safe all the time. Make sure you have enough manpower to protect you along the way!",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Are you ready to hop on a journey as a merchant in medieval bohemia? Choose your character and start making some profit! </i><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Buy!</h2></strong><br>Buy low, sell high, trading at its simplest form. 18 different trade goods to choose from.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel!</h2></strong><br>11 unique cities to travel to! Find which one pays the most for your goods.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sell!</h2></strong><br>A good merchant always finds a way to fill their pockets. It's up to you to find the most profitable route.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recruit!</h2></strong><br>Roads aren't safe all the time. Make sure you have enough manpower to protect you along the way!",
    "short_description": "Fast-paced trade simulation game with RPG elements. Choose your character, buy goods and wander around the medieval Bohemia to make profit. Don't forget to recruit some manpower to keep you safe along the way!",
